  "description": "Deploy production-ready AI agents in one click! Citadel delivers unified governance, end-to-end observability \u0026 rapid development for secure, compliant AI at scale. Built on Azure best practices—turn security blockers into strengths with managed guardrails, cost control \u0026 a shared AI registry. 🛡️📊",
